WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.121
Today there are no letters. Your child only listens.

2
00:00:03.571 --> 00:00:06.905
This is today's page. It has pictures, and no words.

3
00:00:07.355 --> 00:00:13.568
You say the sounds of a word slowly, with a small gap. Your child touches the picture and says the word.

4
00:00:14.018 --> 00:00:17.262
Listen to how slow it is, and how clean each sound is.

5
00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:23.752
The word is sun.

6
00:00:24.652 --> 00:00:26.255
Try the next one with your child.

7
00:00:31.584 --> 00:00:32.625
The word is pig.

8
00:00:33.525 --> 00:00:37.752
If your child is stuck, say the sounds again, closer together. Like this.

9
00:00:41.981 --> 00:00:43.022
The word is pig.

10
00:00:43.922 --> 00:00:47.514
Keep each sound short. Do not add an extra sound on the end.

11
00:00:47.964 --> 00:00:51.872
Mix up the order of the pictures, so your child has to listen each time.

12
00:00:52.322 --> 00:00:57.492
Then swap. Your child picks a picture and says its sounds slowly, and you guess the word.

13
00:00:57.942 --> 00:01:03.354
A few minutes is enough. If this game is hard, play it for a few minutes every day of the plan.
